<title>USA: Wall Street stocks steady to lower at open.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks steady to lower at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened steady to lower on Monday as mild profit-taking hit the Dow industrials following Friday's sharp rally.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average started down three at 5990.</p>
</text>
